  "description": "Soo-ah and Jun-hyuk have known each other since they were young.   \n\nSoo-ah has always thought of Jun-hyuk like a younger brother, but after seeing him all grown up as an adult, she unexpectedly finds herself developing feelings for him.   \nMeanwhile, Soo-ah, who is preparing a portfolio for her art study abroad, worries about how to improve the quality of her nude croquis.   \n\nWhen Jun-hyuk happens to arrive where Soo-ah is, he just smiles at her dilemma.\n\n\"Do you want to see mine? It's just right to eat right now...\"\n\n[Original Webtoon](https://www.lezhin.com/ko/comic/croquis)",
